{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n  \"blocking\": [],\n  \"resolved\": [\n    \"粉色状态的原阻断已解除：中央细竖线贯穿音乐可视区域，底部独立光点明确标识播放位置，不再容易将当前位置误读为普通音符。\",\n    \"紫色状态同样具有清晰的中央时间指示，颜色与当前状态一致。\",\n    \"时间指示与真实音乐节点可以区分。竖线经过发声节点属于正常的播放位置交叠，不需要额外伪造无发声时的音乐光点。\",\n    \"两张编码静帧均未发现新增有效内容裁切、文字遮挡或影响节点辨识的遮挡。底部指示光点完整可见，未触及画面边缘。\",\n    \"音乐轨迹、节点分布及连接关系未见明显新增破坏。\",\n    \"右栏极简密度没有造成新的视觉阻断，不将密度偏好列为问题。\"\n  ],\n  \"not_verified\": [\n    \"仅审查提供的两张编码后静帧，无法确认32秒全程在音符间隙中持续显示时间指示。\",\n    \"无法凭静帧验证播放位置与实际音频的时间同步。\",\n    \"无法确认右栏另外两档预览是否完整保留。\"\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f41303f0-166d-4546-ae51-2bbf79d20d14", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261104T130037114368Z", "elapsed_seconds": 67.015, "completed_utc": "2026-11-04T13:01:44.135564+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ef599440365fa12f4acc818a660804f036881341238c0bdc9387dfeca68d6b6e", "attachment_count": 2}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 2, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py":